@startuml
title B — Failover: durable timer, recovery, SMS and late push ACK
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 210
participant "Temporal Server\n+ durable persistence" as T
participant "Workflow worker" as W
participant "Send / reconcile\nactivity workers" as A
database "Application ledger" as DB
participant "Push provider\n+ app" as Push
participant "SMS provider" as SMS
participant "Receipt API\n+ Signal Relay" as R
note over T,Push: Push attempted. No individual ACK. Timer stored durably.
W -> W: Worker process crashes
... timer deadline survives the restart ...
T -> W: New worker replays history; push timer fires
W -> T: Schedule reconcile activity
T -> A: Reconcile existing push attempt
A -> Push: Query provider status if supported
Push --> A: No proof of device delivery
A -> DB: Record UNKNOWN; recheck durable evidence
A --> T: Unconfirmed
T -> W: Workflow resumes; choose SMS fallback
W -> T: Schedule SMS send activity
T -> A: Execute with stable attempt identity and deadline
A -> DB: Transaction: check deadline/evidence; create/reuse SMS attempt\nand acquire send-permit
alt Push evidence already persisted
  DB --> A: Already delivered; deny SMS permit
  A --> T: Delivered without SMS
  T -> W: Resume workflow
  W -> T: Complete DELIVERED
else No evidence yet
  DB --> A: Permit + stable SMS key
  A -> SMS: Send using stable provider key
  SMS --> A: Accepted (not delivery)
  A -> DB: Persist result; retry keeps same key
  A --> T: Activity complete
  SMS -> R: Signed device-level delivered DLR
  R -> DB: Commit receipt + DELIVERED + Signal outbox
  R -> T: Retry delivery Signal until persisted
  T -> W: Process Signal containing committed evidence
  W -> T: Complete DELIVERED; no more sends
  Push -> R: Late application ACK
  R -> DB: Append evidence; no downgrade or new attempt
  note over Push,SMS: Residual cross-channel duplicate is measured.\nCompleted external delivery cannot be undone.
end
@enduml
